1:["$","$Ld",null,{"reaction":{"id":"magnesium","formula":"²⁵Mg(p,γ)²⁶Al","tag":["银河系的放射性示踪","A radioactive tracer of the Galaxy"],"title":["镁铝反应连接实验与 γ 射线天文学","Magnesium–aluminium reactions connect experiments to gamma-ray astronomy"],"text":["铝-26 基态的放射性衰变产生 1.809 MeV 特征 γ 射线，记录银河系近期的元素合成活动。镁-25 的质子俘获反应是其生成路径之一，反应率是解释天文观测的重要输入。","Decay of ground-state aluminium-26 produces a characteristic 1.809 MeV gamma ray, tracing recent nucleosynthesis in the Galaxy. Proton capture on magnesium-25 is one production pathway, and its rate helps interpret astronomical observations."],"task":["测量低能共振及衰变分支，连接地面实验与 γ 射线天文学。","Measure low-energy resonances and decay branches to connect laboratory experiments with gamma-ray astronomy."],"type":["镁铝循环","The Mg–Al cycle"],"product":"²⁶Al + γ","input":"²⁵Mg + p","particle":"γ","tone":"violet","publicProgress":["首批成果精确测量 ²⁵Mg(p,γ)²⁶Al 的 92 keV 共振。论文于 2021 年在线发表，刊于 2022 年 Science Bulletin。","An early result precisely measured the 92 keV ²⁵Mg(p,γ)²⁶Al resonance, published online in 2021 and in Science Bulletin in 2022."],"detector":["BGO 阵列记录俘获反应的 γ 射线及其级联信号，用于确定共振产额。²⁶Al 基态与同核异构态的生成分支需分别考虑。","The BGO array records capture gamma rays and cascades to determine resonance yields. Production branches to the ²⁶Al ground state and isomer must be distinguished."],"references":["magnesium-resonance-2022"]}}]
